yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Editor
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

